            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nAlthough I can see how this can be useful for *some* day-to-day work, this doesn't look like a necessary feature for a good all-round editing experience.\r\n\r\nOn the other hand, there might be a good place for it in the [planned 'mini.cycle'](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim?tab=readme-ov-file#planned-modules) (or similar name). I'll try to think about it during that module development (which does not yet have high priority, I am afraid).\r\n\r\nClosing as \"maybe planned as part of another module\".",
